# benchmark-refresh-watch
owner: looker · cadence: every 2 days · status: SUGGESTED
**I see you want benchmarks kept current for every model off the web — want a loop that refreshes each model's benchmarks on a schedule?**

## Prompt
For each model in the widget, re-check the web for the most common cross-model benchmarks (beyond tok/s) and update the per-model benchmark data so it stays current.

